        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{2a^7}{y^{15}}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(2a^{-2}y^3)^{-2}\\times(2ay^{-3})^3&=\\frac14a^4y^{-6}\\times8a^3y^{-9}\\\\(2a^{-2}y^3)^{-2}\\times(2ay^{-3})^3&=2a^{4+3}y^{-6-9}\\\\(2a^{-2}y^3)^{-2}\\times(2ay^{-3})^3&=2a^7y^{-15}\\\\(2a^{-2}y^3)^{-2}\\times(2ay^{-3})^3&=\\frac{2a^7}{y^{15}}\\end{align*}$$",
